    "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要去哪儿玩几天,AI 会排出行程;航班、住宿、想去的地方都放进去之后,可以按天看,也可以看花了多少。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell the AI assistant at the bottom where you want to go and for how long. It will plan the trip; add flights, lodging, and places to view the itinerary by day and track spending."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要去哪儿玩几天,AI 会排出行程;航班、住宿、想去的地方都放进去之后,可以按天看,也可以看花了多少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要记的事,或从别的 app 分享到 lodo,AI 会整理成记忆条目。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell the AI assistant at the bottom what you want to remember, or share something from another app to Lodo. The AI will organize it as a memory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要记的事,或从别的 app 分享到 lodo,AI 会整理成记忆条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要记的人,姓名、联系方式、喜好都能一起记下来;人和人之间的关系连起来还能看关系图谱。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tell the AI assistant at the bottom who you want to remember. It can save their name, contact details, and preferences, and link people in a relationship graph."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要记的人,姓名、联系方式、喜好都能一起记下来;人和人之间的关系连起来还能看关系图谱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在底下那条「问问 AI」里说一句要记的资产。" : {
      "localizations" : {
